From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mina Her <minacle@live.com>
Date: Mon, 25 May 2026 12:25:25 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Reorganise About page content

- Force RulesSection to remain open by default
- Move RulesSection below the header
- Shift server meta block to the bottom of the page

Rationale: Prioritising the visibility of community rules improves user engagement, while relocating administrative metadata creates a more logical information hierarchy for visitors.

